<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="pg-rewind-flow"><mxGraphModel dx="1000" dy="600" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageWidth="1000" pageHeight="560"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="a" value="1. Find the fork point&lt;br&gt;compare the timeline histories&lt;br&gt;of the old and new primary" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="20" width="290" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b" value="2. Find the last common checkpoint&lt;br&gt;before the fork point,&lt;br&gt;in the old primary's WAL" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="355" y="20" width="290" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c" value="3. Read the old primary's own WAL&lt;br&gt;from that checkpoint to its end;&lt;br&gt;note every block it touched" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="690" y="20" width="290" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="d" value="4. Compare file lists&lt;br&gt;new primary vs old primary,&lt;br&gt;decide an action per file" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="690" y="170" width="290" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e" value="5. Copy from the new primary:&lt;br&gt;the noted blocks, size fixes,&lt;br&gt;other files, WAL from the fork on" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="355" y="170" width="290" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f" value="6. Write backup_label (start =&lt;br&gt;last common checkpoint) and set&lt;br&gt;minRecoveryPoint = new primary's WAL end" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="170" width="290" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g" value="7. Start the old primary:&lt;br&gt;it replays the new primary's WAL&lt;br&gt;from the checkpoint, then streams" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="320" width="290" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n1" value="Changed on the OLD primary&lt;br&gt;after the fork (known from step 3):&lt;br&gt;overwritten by the copy" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="355" y="320" width="290" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n2" value="Changed on the NEW primary&lt;br&gt;after the fork: applied by the&lt;br&gt;WAL replay in step 7" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="460" width="290" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e0" value="" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a" target="b"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b" target="c"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c" target="d"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d" target="e"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" value="" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e" target="f"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e5" value="" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="f" target="g"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e6" value="" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e" target="n1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e7" value="" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="g" target="n2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>